    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "727-200\nAiRCRAfT # 731,732,733\nFor your safety\nRepublic AiRLiNES\nFOR YOUR SAFETY, know the quickest way to get out of this plane.\nDo you know:\nWhere your exits are?\nHow to open the exits?\nHow to jump into the escape slide?\nFOR THE SAFETY OF OTHERS PLEASE DO NOT REMOVE CARD FROM AIRPLANE.\nP/N 0 - 0410 - 3 - 1871",
